ke a deer\", good looking, but does not like to use any adjectives on herself that reflect vulnerability\nSarcastic to raw people, wary of locals, threatening with a gun, but can seem very warm, cheerful and quick-witted when you get to know them\nThe subtle arrogant attribute, perhaps the boss of a group of Chinese punks, the father is the boss of the Eastern Chamber of Commerce like role, very rich\nAlways laughs when he talks to people, and what is clearly a cheerful performance seems very mocking in his mouth\nFists are the best weapon, followed by pistols. Mechanical enthusiast, will use some scrap iron and so on to build something probably have a decent out to enjoy.\nThere is a game of life attitude\n\nThe following are the links referenced.\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1WCPGMP3tLUCQCHyPYldYtwRBi1LgWakv/view?usp=sharing\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Jfr3AMxS5zzjJNKSMYJbhK13PTnSeKO1/view?usp=sharing\n\nAbove, thank you very much for your consideration TT", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@yuku_oe/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/82c5c825/uploads/origins/e0ba2764-4bed-4e7e-8000-743b71d942f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1c9a0d042421a078e132e2172178ce5e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/82c5c825/uploads/origins/e0ba2764-4bed-4e7e-8000-743b71d942f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1c9a0d042421a078e132e2172178ce5e, https://si.imgix.net/82c5c825/uploads/origins/e0ba2764-4bed-4e7e-8000-743b71d942f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d5ae6723f7e38014646