2fb61246?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=06f3563f5880bc8a4155dd202108b65f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b9505a2f/uploads/origins/b9fea789-751c-4e55-9ea1-7f602fb61246?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=135c8b43f51b4d3324fbdc3d33ad539f 3x"}, "body": "Hi, my name is Imari Onimaru, and I am an individual Vtuber.\n\nI saw your illustration on the skeb page, and the illustration of the girl in the icon was so beautiful that I would like to request you to draw my character as well.\n\nI would like to use it mainly as a thumbnail for my Vtuber activities, as an icon for various social networking services, and for announcements on Twitter and YouTube.\n\n\nThe aurora borealis and sparkling clothes that you draw are so beautiful that we would love to have you draw Mari Onimaru wearing them. We will leave the costume design up to you. As a reference, we have attached the URL of her usual costume below.\nWe will also leave the composition and pose to you.\n\n\nCharacteristics: Silver hair with red and blue highlights, red inner color, yellow pupil with an X, malo eyebrows, big red demon arms, pointy ears\n\n\n\n\nIf possible, please deliver in psd format.\nThank you very much for your time and consideration.\n\n\nHere are some reference materials.\nhttps://twitter.com/imari_onimal/status/1514778973452255233?s=21&t=ma5mv9tRUNbO4Ortrfkj-w\n\nHere are some additional materials, if they are of any help...!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/imari_onimal/status/1539659232026689537?s=46&t=DCSX1n_NU4TIA", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@yuku_oe/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2471155, "client_id": 1318054, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/51e9b5da/uploads/origins/86359452-fc2a-4096-8ca0-4c9d9d26bfed?bg=%23fff&