n└ She is a VTuber who mainly deals with space (especially planets) and TRPG\n∙ Costume is left up to us.\n└ The document URL contains a collection of materials for the regular costume and a separate folder for the new costume\n└ We are open to anything, whether it's a regular costume, a new costume, or a completely different outfit designed by Yuku-sama!\n└ The ratio of the illustration is up to you!\n(However, we may adjust the ratio to 16:9 for use in movie thumbnails.)\n(However, we may adjust the ratio to 16:9 for use in the video thumbnail.) ・If necessary, you may freely use the \"Night Sky One-piece Texture\" included in the folder (with permission from the illustrator to process and add to it).\n\nUsage】】・Posting on social networking sites\nUse of the textures on social networking sites.\nUse as a thumbnail for videos and videos distributed by monetized channels.\nIf you can use it as a thumbnail, we would be very happy to receive a psd format with the background and the person separated. For this reason, we would prefer a relatively simple background .......\n\n\nIf you have time, please let me know.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_ONjp1cnWnE7kOWSIzQCWH_Ozj7-_ILE?usp=share_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@yuku_oe/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2471155, "client_id": 407829, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8aef6c08/uploads/origins/d5d40c74-6e25-4ec6-87da-daf1435fa046?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a238e96ff9a3be7f0df36d79c862217", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8aef6c08/uploads/origins/d5d40c74-6e25-4ec6-87da-daf1435fa046?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a238e96ff9a3be7f0df36d79c862217, https://si.imgix.net/8aef6c08/uploads/origins/d5d40c74-6e25-4ec6-87da-daf1435fa046?